  data: {
    LLM: '1. The Deal: 5 cards dealt to each player.\n2. 1st Betting Round: Starts from the player to the left of the blinds/dealer.\n3. The Draw: Players discard 0-3 cards (or 4 if holding an Ace) and receive replacements.\n4. 2nd Betting Round: A final chance to bet or bluff based on the improved hand.\n5. Showdown: Remaining players reveal hands.',
    Player: '1. The Deal: 5 cards dealt to each player.\n2. 1st Betting Round: Starts from the player to the left of the blinds/dealer.\n3. The Draw: Players discard 0-3 cards (or 4 if holding an Ace) and receive replacements.\n4. 2nd Betting Round: A final chance to bet or bluff based on the improved hand.\n5. Showdown: Remaining players reveal hands.',
